 "name_en": "Customer Returns for Material with Variant Configuration (7KW)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Customer Returns for Material with Variant Configuration (7KW)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio902b337cc1154553aca3afac42092eba\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio902b337cc1154553aca3afac42092eba__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">The scope item is dedicated to handle material with variant configuration for a customer returns process.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">A configurable material using the Advanced Variant Configuration can be included in returns order. It can be single-level and multi-level configurable material. Configuration can be copied over from a sales order when created with reference or maintained during creation without reference. Sales price is calculated with condition for configurations. A returns delivery is automatically generated once the returns order is released. After goods receipt, the inspection takes place at the warehouse and final logistical follow up is decided. Refund can be determined either directly when releasing the returns order, or after the inspection. Compensation to customer by credit memo is available.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio902b337cc1154553aca3afac42092eba__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\" id=\"loio902b337cc1154553aca3afac42092eba__loio896288146b284d7d86974126e8120ea6_ul_npd_2sk_lcc\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Create returns order for material with variant configuration</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Generate returns delivery</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Post goods receipt</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Perform material inspection</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Determine refund</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Create credit memo</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio902b337cc1154553aca3afac42092eba__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\" id=\"loio902b337cc1154553aca3afac42092eba__loio896288146b284d7d86974126e8120ea6_ul_n1f_xdr_lcc\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Improve your customer returns end to end process for configurable material covering single-level and multi-level configuration.</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Transfer configuration information among different sales documents.</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Get sales pricing and print-out according to the configuration.</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio902b337cc1154553aca3afac42092eba__non_standard\">\n      <p class=\"p\"><span class=\"ph emphasis\">Exclude from Default Activation</span></p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio902b337cc1154553aca3afac42092eba__non_standard_reason\">\n      <p class=\"p\"><span class=\"ph emphasis\">Reason for Excluding from Default Activation</span></p>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>含变式配置的物料客户退货 (7KW)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio902b337cc1154553aca3afac42092eba\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio902b337cc1154553aca3afac42092eba__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">此范围项目专门处理具有客户退货流程变式配置的物料。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">使用高级变式配置的可配置物料可以包含在退货订单中。可以是单级和多级可配置物料。在使用参考创建销售订单时可以从销售订单中复制配置，也可以在无参考创建期间维护配置。销售价格通过配置的条件计算。审批退货订单后，将自动生成退货交货。收货后，在仓库进行检验并决定最终物流跟进。退款可以在下达退货订单时直接确定，也可以在检验后确定。可通过贷项凭证向客户进行补偿。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio902b337cc1154553aca3afac42092eba__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\" id=\"loio902b337cc1154553aca3afac42092eba__loio896288146b284d7d86974126e8120ea6_ul_npd_2sk_lcc\">\n       <li class=\"li\">使用变式配置为物料创建退货订单</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">生成退货交货</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">过账收货</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">执行物料检验</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">确定退款</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">创建贷项凭证</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio902b337cc1154553aca3afac42092eba__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\" id=\"loio902b337cc1154553aca3afac42092eba__loio896288146b284d7d86974126e8120ea6_ul_n1f_xdr_lcc\">\n       <li class=\"li\">改进涵盖单级和多级配置的可配置物料的端到端客户退货流程。</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">在不同销售凭证之间传输配置信息。</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">根据配置获取销售定价和打印件。</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio902b337cc1154553aca3afac42092eba__non_standard\">\n      <p class=\"p\"><span class=\"ph emphasis\">从默认激活中排除</span></p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio902b337cc1154553aca3afac42092eba__non_standard_reason\">\n      <p class=\"p\"><span class=\"ph emphasis\">从缺省激活中排除的原因</span></p>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
